  "notes": "Ichidan verb ({一段動詞|いちだんどうし}).\n- Negative: {埋|うも}れない\n- Polite: {埋|うも}れます\n- Te-form: {埋|うも}れて\n- Past: {埋|うも}れた\n\nUSAGE:\nIntransitive counterpart of {埋|う}める (to bury, to fill). Often appears in the pattern ～に{埋|うも}れる (to be buried in/under ~).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {雪|ゆき}に{埋|うも}れる: to be buried in snow\n- {歴史|れきし}に{埋|うも}れる: to be lost to history\n- {書類|しょるい}に{埋|うも}れる: to be buried under paperwork",
